{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54552","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暴兵气，如火又如烟。\n或似旗{旛巾=方}幷战（京本作「五」）马，低头仰（京本作「倾」）[尾]（面）（从辛本、川本、京本改）向军前（京本作「前军」），触战血成川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}